# Omni long-form playbook (locked 2026-08-14)

**Reference episode:** `006_Could-Life-Exist-Under-The-Ice-Of-Europa` → `europa_broadcast_v01.mp4`.  
Build every future long in this format/style. Iterate rules when QA teaches something new — do not silently regress.

## Pipeline (after Growth System gate)

1. **~1-minute parts** — write → script QA → Ben Orbit Narrator VO → Omni Flash plates for that part only → picture QA → approve → next part.
2. Never gen the full episode in one pass. Regen only failed minutes/plates.
3. **~8–10 unique ~8s Omni plates per VO minute** — no freeze-pad, no scenery loop (`orbit-cutscene-no-reuse` + `orbit-omni-section-qa`).
4. Assemble with paired **xfade + acrossfade**; env-gate water SFX; single Orbit / single face / travel-facing / one bottom glow.
5. After all parts lock: **brand intro** · **chapter cards** · soft-join parts · **like/subscribe outro** → `09_Final-Export/*_broadcast_v01.mp4`.
6. Then **4–8 punch Shorts** (~22–28s) from locked part roughs (`orbit-shorts-punch-first`).

## Picture / character bar

- VO-literal journey; Orbit *in* the scene (bank/skim/dive), not a sticker.
- Premium CGI 3D polish; cream eyes + pupils; env honesty (no bubbles in vacuum).
- Clipper / craft: vacuum/orbital only unless the beat is explicitly under-ice without craft.

